B.IS=new A.eV("asked","What the angel asked","Jibril came and asked the Prophet (peace be upon him) what faith is, what Islam is, and what excellence is. Read his answer below. Do not swap it for a shorter list of your own.","This is Sahih al-Bukhari. A wording in Sahih Muslim adds detail. If they seem to differ, ask the imam. Do not pick one and ignore the other.",B.G,50)
B.a0D=s(["33:40"],t.s)
B.IY=new A.eV("messenger","The last messenger","Muhammad (peace be upon him) is the last messenger. We love him and follow him. We do not worship him.",null,B.a0D,null)
B.a_X=s(["2:2"],t.s)
B.IT=new A.eV("quran","The Quran","The Quran is the word of Allah, in Arabic. English on this screen is a meaning, not a replacement. This app is not a tafsir.",null,B.a_X,null)
B.a09=s([B.IV,B.IZ,B.J0,B.IS,B.IY,B.IT],t.IL)
B.IK=new A.yt("belief","Belief","Who Allah is, what to believe, and the Book.",B.uG,B.a09)
B.IX=new A.eV("five","The five","The Prophet (peace be upon him) said Islam stands on five things. They are in his words below, in his order.",null,B.G,8)
B.a1P=s(["47:19"],t.s)
B.IR=new A.eV("testimony","The testimony","The first pillar is the shahada. Open the Shahada page for the Arabic and how someone says it with the imam. This app does not convert you.",null,B.a1P,null)
B.a07=s(["4:103"],t.s)
B.J1=new A.eV("prayer","The prayer","Prayer is at set times. In the mosque, follow the imam. People are usually taught these fard units: Fajr 2, Dhuhr 4, Asr 4, Maghrib 3, Isha 4. That count is the common teaching. It is not this verse. Extra sunnah units differ. Follow this mosque.",null,B.a07,null)
B.ZG=s(["5:6"],t.s)
B.J_=new A.eV("wudu","Washing before prayer","The Quran names the wash: the face, the arms to the elbows, a wipe of the head, and the feet to the ankles. A cast, or no water, is for the imam \u2014 not this page.",null,B.ZG,null)
B.a2m=s(["2:43"],t.s)
B.IQ=new A.eV("zakat","Zakat","Zakat is a required share of qualifying wealth, not a tip. Many people give 2.5% of cash and gold after a lunar year, once they are above the nisab. That rate is the common teaching. It is not this verse. This app does not work out your number.",null,B.a2m,null)
B.a1e=s(["2:183"],t.s)
B.IM=new A.eV("fast","Fasting in Ramadan","Able adults fast from before Fajr until Maghrib in Ramadan. This mosque announces the first day after the moon. If a website disagrees, follow this mosque.",null,B.a1e,null)
B.a26=s(["3:97"],t.s)
B.IW=new A.eV("hajj","Hajj","Hajj is once in a lifetime for the person who is able. It is in Dhul Hijjah. Ask this mosque for a trusted group. Do not book from an advert alone.",null,B.a26,null)
