B.IU=new A.eV("harm","Do not harm people","Someone asked whose Islam is best. Read the answer below.",null,B.G,11)
B.IN=new A.eV("brother","Wish good for others","The Prophet (peace be upon him) tied faith to wishing for your brother what you wish for yourself. Read it below.",null,B.G,13)
